    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "NITI Aayog was formed on January 1, 2015, replacing the 65-year-old Planning Commission.",
        "The Prime Minister of India serves as the ex-officio Chairperson of NITI Aayog.",
        "First Five-Year Plan was based on the Harrod-Domar model, focusing primarily on agriculture."
